e Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nNadia was incredibly excited about her upcoming graduation. On the day she was supposed to receive her degree, her parents said they had a surprise for her. When they revealed two new hardcover books as her surprise graduation gift, she managed a smile.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Nadia ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Amusement\nB) Disappointment\nC) Joy\nD) Delight\nE) Curiosity\nF) Fear\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Nadia feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She expected her parents to be absent at her graduation\nB) Her parents gave her books, which she didn't like as a gift\nC) She didn't graduate on her expected date\nD) She loved the gifts her parents got her","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.01590638937927973,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6a29aa9dc5a833d994f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483874759,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:44:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"93cce46a69f14d45950fab4f2302d8ab"}